OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 8 JUN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Monteverdi
OL,5,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,6,     GMonteverdi's beginnings in
OL,7,     GCremona, with early publications
OL,8,     Gand musical training.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,11,     Gmusic from pianist Charles Owen
OL,12,     Gand violinist Charlie Lovell-
OL,13,     GJones, as well as the jazz duo
OL,14,     GHis 'n' Hers and their band.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,18,     Gfavourites.
