OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 8 JUN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe CBSO conducted by Alpesh
OL,6,     GChauhan present a concert of
OL,7,     Gmusic from America which includes
OL,8,     Gthe double timpani concerto by
OL,9,     GPhilip Glass and works by Carlos
OL,10,     GSimon and Rachmaninov.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Musicians on the Couch
OL,12,     GHow does music affect the mind?
OL,13,     GWriter Amanda Dalton explores the
OL,14,     Grelationship between the two, in
OL,15,     Gall its forms. She begins in
OL,16,     GVienna, powerhouse of
OL,17,     Gpsychoanalysis and music.
